WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.960
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: no using SCPs to

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.600
affect the outcome on American Idol, or any
other reality show competition!

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.080
Previous violations of this rule have included:&nbsp;

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.240
showing his least favorite&nbsp;
American Idol contestant

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:19.920
SCP-096’s face in the hope that it would
hunt him down, sneaking SCP-348 to a Hell’s

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:24.960
Kitchen contestant, and releasing SCP-049
into the house on The Bachelorette because,

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:29.200
quote, “None of them are good enough for
Rachel, so they all deserve to die.”

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:34.240
Dr. Bright is to be reminded that, if he cannot
stay on his best behavior and stay out of

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.920
the competition, his tv privileges will be
revoked.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.920
And does he really want to risk missing the
latest season of Love is Blind?

